<% content_for :title, "Open Scriptorium" %>

<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto py-16">
  <header class="border-b border-[--color-rule] pb-8 mb-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif text-[--color-ink]">Open Scriptorium</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-[--color-ink-soft] font-serif italic">
      An open reading room for scripture and the voices that have read it.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="prose prose-lg font-serif text-[--color-ink] leading-relaxed space-y-4">
    <p>
      Open Scriptorium is under construction. The corpus is still being
      assembled. Eventually you will find here parallel translations of the
      Hebrew Bible, the Greek New Testament, the Septuagint, and various
      apocryphal texts &mdash; alongside historical commentary from Philo, Josephus,
      Origen, and later patristic and post-patristic voices &mdash; all
      under permissive licenses, all cross-referenced down to the verse.
    </p>

    <p class="font-greek text-xl mt-8">
      Ἐν ἀρχῇ ἦν ὁ λόγος.
    </p>

    <p class="font-hebrew text-2xl mt-2" lang="he">
      בְּרֵאשִׁית בָּרָא אֱלֹהִים אֵת הַשָּׁמַיִם וְאֵת הָאָרֶץ׃
    </p>
  </section>

  <footer class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-[--color-rule] text-sm text-[--color-ink-soft]">
    <p>
      Open Scriptorium &middot; <abbr title="A free, libre, open-source software project">FOSS</abbr>
    </p>
  </footer>
</div>
